# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#  Vision Public School — Environment Variables (Vercel deploy)
#  Ye file sirf EXAMPLE hai — asli values .env me rakhna (git-ignored)
# ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# 1) DATABASE_URL — Supabase se:
#    Supabase Dashboard → aapka Project → ⚙️ Project Settings (gear icon, left me neeche)
#      → Database → "Connection string" section → tab "Transaction" (pooler, PORT 6543)
#    [include-one-line] Shape ye hota hai:
#      postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:<TUMHARA_DB_PASSWORD>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres
#    Dhyan: <TUMHARA_DB_PASSWORD> ki jagah project banate waqt jo password likha tha wo daalo
#           (password me special chars hon to URL-encode karo, jaise @ -> %40)
DATABASE_URL=postgresql://postgres.abcdwxyzefgh:DEMO-PASSWORD@aws-0-ap-south-1.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres

# 2) AUTH_SECRET — login sessions sign karne ka secret + /api/setup ka password.
#    Koi bhi 64-char random hex daalo (terminal: `openssl rand -hex 32`)
AUTH_SECRET=PASTE-YOUR-64-CHAR-RANDOM-HEX-HERE

# 3) AUTH_TRUST_HOST — Auth.js ko batata hai ki apna domain jaante ho (Vercel/sandbox ke liye true zaroori)
AUTH_TRUST_HOST=true

# ── Local dev ke liye kuch mat karo ────────────────────────────────
# Bina DATABASE_URL ke app embedded Postgres (PGlite, .pglite folder) se chalta
# hai — koi setup nahi chahiye. Production (Vercel) me sirf upar ke 3 vars paste karo.
